{"id":"e8997cda0865ef9b","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-successor-function.md","title":"Successor Function $S$","display":"df-successor-function — Successor Function $S$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-successor-function","aliases":["58-df-successor-function","58-df-S"],"display":"df-successor-function — Successor Function $S$","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-successor-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-successor-function</span><span>58-df-S</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-successor-function — Successor Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S : \\omega \\to \\omega\">\\(S : \\omega \\to \\omega\\)</span> (后继函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\omega\">\\(x \\in \\omega\\)</span> (输入)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function} \\vdash S\\coloneqq \\{\\langle x,x\\cup\\{x\\}\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function} \\vdash S\\coloneqq \\{\\langle x,x\\cup\\{x\\}\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function\\text{-}typing} \\vdash \\mathrm{Function}(S,\\omega,\\omega)\\land \\forall x\\in\\omega\\;(S(x)=x\\cup\\{x\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}successor\\text{-}function\\text{-}typing} \\vdash \\mathrm{Function}(S,\\omega,\\omega)\\land \\forall x\\in\\omega\\;(S(x)=x\\cup\\{x\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 的基函数之一</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(x) = x + 1\">\\(S(x) = x + 1\\)</span> 是后继运算</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fff5dc780f29d486\" href=\"?note=fff5dc780f29d486\" title=\"58-df-zero-function\">58-df-zero-function</a> — 零函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8a304812dec1e29f\" href=\"?note=8a304812dec1e29f\" title=\"58-df-projection-function\">58-df-projection-function</a> — 投影函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" href=\"?note=1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" title=\"58-df-primitive-recursive\">58-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"